1. GOTO url: "https://www.amazon.ae/gp/your-account/order-history"
2. PAUSE_FOR_USER reason: "AUTHENTICATION_PASSKEY_OR_OTP"
3. NOTE The user completes login, passkey, OTP, or any authentication challenge in the headed window; never type, inspect, copy, log, or store any authentication value.
4. ASSERT condition: "authenticated Amazon UAE order-history page is visible"
5. NOTE Capture order evidence only. Exclude delivery addresses, payment credentials, gift messages, browser cookies, session state, and full payment or account numbers.
